    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llLookAt(vector Target, float Strength, float Damping);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Cause object to point its <b>up</b> axis (positive z) towards <b>target</b>, while keeping its <b>forward</b> axis (positive x) below the horizon.</p>
  <p>Continues to track <b>target</b> until <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlStopLookAt" target="_blank">llStopLookAt</a> is called.</p>
</p>
